From: Michael Curtis <mcurtis@genxmsp.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:11:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] M-0 rollback-compat build: pre-M-0 application + the M-0
 one-click unsubscribe endpoint

Rollback target for the Marketing M-0 release (never the plain pre-M-0 build). Keeps RFC 8058
List-Unsubscribe POSTs in emails already sent by M-0 working if the application is rolled back.
The footer links of those emails keep working through the pre-M-0 confirmation pages and the
M-0 stage-1 compatibility SQL. Requires M-0 stage 1 (marketing_unsubscribe_by_token); never run
with M-0 stage 2.

Contents: src/app/api/email/unsubscribe/[token]/route.ts and its pure link helper
src/lib/marketing/compliance/unsubscribeLinks.ts, identical to Marketing M-0; endpoint tests.
---
 .../api/email/unsubscribe/[token]/route.ts    |  87 +++++++++++++
 .../unsubscribe/__tests__/route.m0.test.ts    | 122 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../marketing/compliance/unsubscribeLinks.ts  |  48 +++++++
 3 files changed, 257 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/app/api/email/unsubscribe/[token]/route.ts
 create mode 100644 src/app/api/email/unsubscribe/__tests__/route.m0.test.ts
